  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soul City:HIV prevention &amp; Address SRHR 2010-2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Soul City:HIV prevention &amp; Address SRHR 2010-2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Soul City is a South African based NGO with a regional programme in   countries across Southern Africa.It intends to intensify its regional intervention in order to accelerate HIV prevention &amp; address key SRH  priorities. It will do this through regionally coordinated Social &amp;   Behaviour Change Communication (SBCC) initiatives in; Lesotho,        Malawi, Mozambique, Namibia, Zambia, Swaziland &amp; Zimbabwe</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Soul City &#xe4;r en sydafrikansk baserad NGO med ett regionalt program i  l&#xe4;nder i s&#xf6;dra Africa.It avser att intensifiera sitt regionala        insatser f&#xf6;r att p&#xe5;skynda hivprevention och ta itu med viktiga SRH    prioriteringar. Det kommer att g&#xf6;ra detta genom regionalt samordnade  Umg&#xe4;nge och Behaviour Change Communication (SBCC) initiativ i,        Lesotho, Malawi, Mo&#xe7;ambique, Namibia, Zambia, Swaziland och Zimbabwe</narrative>
  </description>
